,"source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233231","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5001400-1844751498230524","game_id":"steam-5001400","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.0.9876 — The Story, 14 Scrolls and Levels With Their Own Rules","summary":"The story A prelude before the first level. An old phone, a snake made of little squares biting its own tail, something tearing the loop open, and the fall into the Pit. Full length in SKILL MATCH; one line in ARCADE. 14 scrolls to recover. Every SKILL MATCH level you win, 1 to 6 plus hell, in both chapters, hands you a scroll. When the boss falls, the light of the Pit tells it to you over that level's song. The Library, inside THE ARCHIVE, keeps the scrolls and the OATHS in two tabs. Redeemed o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T04:42:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230524","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5001400-1843481262698628","game_id":"steam-5001400","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.0.7110 — Patch Notes","summary":"What's new: Demo v0.0.7110 The horde stops being one single bug. Every common enemy is now born with one of four strains: its own colour, mottling and blotches. Same species, different bodies. When eighty of them pile on top of you, you notice. The specials look special. The ALPHA, the ANCHOR and the PARASITE (Skill-Match, danger 2 and up) and the ELITES no longer announce themselves with just a ring. Now the body does the talking: a rainbow running across the ALPHA, chrome on the ANCHOR, sick i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T01:34:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/extern